        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Maria Bello, Hugh Jackman, Jake Gyllenhaal, Viola Davis, Terrence Howard, Melissa Leo, Paul Dano\n- Films: Permanent Midnight, Payback, Coyote Ugly, The Cooler, A History of Violence, Thank You for Smoking, The Jane Austen Book Club, Prisoners, Lights Out\n\nFacts:\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Permanent Midnight\" in 1998.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Payback\" in 1999.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Coyote Ugly\" in 2000.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"The Cooler\" in 2003.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"A History of Violence\" in 2005.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Thank You for Smoking\" in 2006.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"The Jane Austen Book Club\" in 2007.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Prisoners\" in 2013.\n- The 2013 film \"Prisoners\" had an ensemble cast including Hugh Jackman, Jake Gyllenhaal, Viola Davis, Maria Bello, Terrence Howard, Melissa Leo, and Paul Dano.\n- Maria Bello appeared in the film \"Lights Out\" in 2016.",
